## Tests

- `crates/tools/tests/acceptance.rs`: the two tests of step 8. Run `cargo test -p jackioh-tools --test acceptance ci_scope_e2e`, then `cargo test -p jackioh-tools --test acceptance`. The second also runs the existing `ci_scope_*` scans and `v23`; acceptance.rs is already a listed structural reader.
- `apps/web/src/net/ci-scope.test.ts`: the new `on`/`off` entries and the two tests of step 6. `apps/web/src/wasm/pkg` does not exist until the WASM module is built, so run `sh scripts/build-wasm.sh` once, then `pnpm exec vitest run --project web apps/web/src/net/ci-scope.test.ts`. (`pnpm --dir apps/web test src/net/ci-scope.test.ts` does both; without the build, the file fails to load with "Failed to resolve import ./pkg/jackioh_wasm.js".)
