  - **Arm order.** Temporarily move the `crates/tools/src/* | crates/tools/fuzz-corpus/*) ;;` line above the keep-on arm. The vitest file must fail for `replay.rs`, `main.rs`, `catalog.rs`, `patches.rs` and the beside-`fuzz.rs` cases. Then put it back.
